      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 7,
        "start": 7
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE THOMAS: Mr. Singh, the -- if there was no guidance as to what \"usual and customary\" meant, do you think that an employee and -- sorry -- the Respondent here would also -- could also be accused of having made false statements? If there was no guidance whatsoever as to what it meant."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Thomas",
      "case_id": "2022-21-1326",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "703408db98d243c6baa82b8422d7dd82ca1d956ddd1aef8b987ecdced67803bf",
      "evidence_id": "ev-703408db98d2-0000-0003",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 7,
        "start": 7
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE THOMAS: So what -- what would you say it is?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Kagan",
      "case_id": "2022-21-1326",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "703408db98d243c6baa82b8422d7dd82ca1d956ddd1aef8b987ecdced67803bf",
      "evidence_id": "ev-703408db98d2-0001-0000",
