        "start": 54
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE JACKSON: All right. And so then the only question, I thought, is whether the allegations that are being made about their subjective beliefs matter."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Carter G. Phillips",
      "case_id": "2022-21-1326",
